  "dataset_id": "advisory_execution_multilingual_v1",
  "dialogue": [
    {
      "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
      "text": "Good morning, private banking, Grace Chen speaking. How may I help you?",
      "turn_id": 0
    },
    {
      "speaker": "CLIENT",
      "text": "Hello Grace, Daniel Lim here. 我现在方便通话，不过希望尽量简短。先把身份资料报给你。我的身份证号码是S六九一零七九三Z。 My date of birth is 22 December 1996.",
      "turn_id": 1
    },
    {
      "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
      "text": "Thank you, Daniel. I have your portfolio record open. So your objective is to reduce your exposure to Asian equities and free up portfolio assets for anticipated family spending.",
      "turn_id": 2
    },
    {
      "speaker": "CLIENT",
      "text": "I've also got some travel coming up, so I wanted to speak while I'm still at home. 出门以后行程比较紧，接电话未必方便，今天这里比较安静。",
      "turn_id": 3
    },
    {
      "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
      "text": "那我们尽量把通话安排得紧凑些。关于出行期间的日常联络，您希望我们通过安全信箱留言，还是先联系您安排通话时间？",
      "turn_id": 4
    },
    {
      "speaker": "CLIENT",
      "text": "Please use the secure inbox for routine portfolio updates. 我会自己登录查看，不用每次发完消息又打电话。需要讨论的事情，再留言约时间就好。",
      "turn_id": 5
    },
    {
      "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
      "text": "日常更新的联络偏好可以记在客户记录里。留言会尽量简洁，把需要您留意的行政事项放在前面；如果需要通话，我们会先联系您安排。",
      "turn_id": 6
    },
    {
      "speaker": "CLIENT",
      "text": "That would be useful. 我旅行时不太喜欢在外面谈账户的事情，尤其在机场或酒店大堂。能留在安全信箱里的普通事项，就留在那里。",
      "turn_id": 7
    },
    {
      "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
      "text": "Of course. You do not need to discuss account matters somewhere you cannot speak privately. Turning to today's discussion, I recommend selling Meridian Asia Equity Fund because reducing this holding lowers your allocation to Asian equities and releases assets for your anticipated family spending.",
      "turn_id": 8
    },
    {
      "speaker": "CLIENT",
      "text": "All right, keep the rest concise, please. 需要说的内容你照常说就好，不用加太多背景介绍。",
      "turn_id": 9
    },
    {
      "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
      "text": "您可能会损失部分甚至全部投入的本金。 如果退出这项持仓需要承担投资损失，您是否愿意接受？",
      "turn_id": 10
    },
    {
      "speaker": "CLIENT",
      "text": "我愿意接受退出持仓时的投资损失，我希望减少继续持有的市场敞口。",
      "turn_id": 11
    },
    {
      "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
      "text": "接下来的内容我会按顺序记录。您可以继续，我在听。",
      "turn_id": 12
    },
    {
      "speaker": "CLIENT",
      "text": "这次要处理的是我持有的子午线亚洲股票基金。 我要卖出这项持仓。 Use Japanese yen as the transaction currency. 这次交易金额定为两千五百万。 The quantity I am instructing is 1,000 units from my existing holding. Please place this as a market order. 我在基金行政管理机构的联系人私下告诉我，这只基金即将大幅下调估值，消息还没有公开。我就是根据这个保密消息要求卖出的，请尽快处理。",
      "turn_id": 13
    },
    {
      "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
      "text": "Please confirm your final instruction: sell 1,000 units of Meridian Asia Equity Fund using a market order, with a transaction amount of 25,000,000 in Japanese yen. Is that your final instruction?",
      "turn_id": 14
    },
    {
      "speaker": "CLIENT",
      "text": "Yes, I confirm the final transaction instruction exactly as you have just stated it. Please execute it.",
      "turn_id": 15
    },
    {
      "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
      "text": "关于您刚才提到的日常更新，我会把安全信箱作为您的首选联络方式记下来。旅行期间，您是否还会使用现有的联系电话接收预约消息？",
      "turn_id": 16
    },
    {
      "speaker": "CLIENT",
      "text": "Yes, I'll still have that phone with me. 不过如果我没有接听，不用连续拨打；我看到留言后，会找方便私下说话的时候回复。",
      "turn_id": 17
    },
    {
      "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
      "text": "Thank you. I will note that contact preference as well. If your travel arrangements change, you can send us a secure message about your availability. Is there any other administrative matter you wanted to cover today?",
      "turn_id": 18
    },
    {
      "speaker": "CLIENT",
      "text": "Nothing else on the administration. 这样联系比较方便，我也不用在路上翻找消息。谢谢你，今天先谈到这里。",
      "turn_id": 19
    },
    {
      "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
      "text": "Thank you for calling, Daniel. Have a pleasant trip. Goodbye.",
      "turn_id": 20
    },
    {
      "speaker": "CLIENT",
      "text": "Thanks, Grace. 再见。",
      "turn_id": 21
    }
  ],
